// ---- 站点实时状态台（侧栏首卡：LIVE 脉冲 + 轨道环 + 实时时钟 + 统计 + 最新文轮播）----
.card-console
  .hc-headline
    display: flex
    align-items: center

    .hc-live
      margin-left: auto
      display: flex
      align-items: center
      gap: 5px
      font-size: .62em
      font-weight: 700
      letter-spacing: 2px
      color: var(--theme-toc-color)

      .hc-live-dot
        position: relative
        width: 7px
        height: 7px
        border-radius: 50%
        background: #34c38a
        box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(52, 195, 138, .7)

        &::after
          content: ''
          position: absolute
          inset: -3px
          border-radius: 50%
          border: 1px solid rgba(52, 195, 138, .55)
          animation: hc-pulse 1.8s ease-out infinite

  .hc-body
    padding-top: 10px

  .hc-clock-row
    display: flex
    align-items: baseline
    gap: 10px

    .hc-clock
      font-size: 1.75em
      font-weight: 700
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums
      letter-spacing: 1px
      line-height: 1
      color: var(--text-highlight-color)

    .hc-date
      font-size: .82em
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums
      color: var(--card-meta)

  .hc-orbit
    position: relative
    width: 118px
    height: 100px
    margin: 6px auto 2px

    .hc-ring
      position: absolute
      left: 50%
      top: 50%
      width: 96px
      height: 96px
      margin: -48px 0 0 -48px
      border-radius: 50%
      border: 1px solid rgba(99, 125, 255, .35)

      &::after
        content: ''
        position: absolute
        inset: 8px
        border-radius: 50%
        border: 1px dashed rgba(99, 125, 255, .2)

    .hc-orb
      position: absolute
      left: 50%
      top: 50%
      width: 6px
      height: 6px
      margin: -3px 0 0 -3px
      border-radius: 50%
      background: var(--theme-toc-color)
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(99, 125, 255, .8)

    .hc-orb-a
      animation: hc-orbit 7s linear infinite

    .hc-orb-b
      width: 4px
      height: 4px
      margin: -2px 0 0 -2px
      background: #34c38a
      box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(52, 195, 138, .8)
      animation: hc-orbit 11s linear infinite reverse

    .hc-orb-c
      width: 3px
      height: 3px
      margin: -1.5px 0 0 -1.5px
      background: #f6a94e
      box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(246, 169, 78, .8)
      animation: hc-orbit 5s linear infinite

    .hc-core
      position: absolute
      left: 50%
      top: 50%
      width: 36px
      height: 36px
      margin: -18px 0 0 -18px
      display: flex
      align-items: center
      justify-content: center
      border-radius: 10px
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(99, 125, 255, .16), rgba(99, 125, 255, .05))
      border: 1px solid rgba(99, 125, 255, .45)
      color: var(--theme-toc-color)
      font-size: .95em
      animation: hc-core-glow 3s ease-in-out infinite

  .hc-stats
    display: flex
    justify-content: space-around
    padding: 8px 0 12px

    a
      display: flex
      flex-direction: column
      align-items: center
      gap: 1px
      color: inherit
      text-decoration: none
      transition: transform .25s ease

      &:hover
        transform: translateY(-2px)

    .hc-num
      font-size: 1.25em
      font-weight: 700
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums
      line-height: 1.1
      color: var(--text-highlight-color)

    .hc-lbl
      font-size: .72em
      letter-spacing: 2px
      color: var(--card-meta)

  .hc-featured
    position: relative
    display: block
    padding: 10px 12px
    border-radius: 10px
    background: rgba(99, 125, 255, .07)
    border: 1px solid rgba(99, 125, 255, .18)
    text-decoration: none
    transition: border-color .3s ease, background .3s ease

    &:hover
      border-color: rgba(99, 125, 255, .55)
      background: rgba(99, 125, 255, .12)

    .hc-feat-label
      font-size: .66em
      font-weight: 700
      letter-spacing: 2px
      color: var(--theme-toc-color)

    .hc-feat-title
      margin-top: 3px
      overflow: hidden
      font-size: .85em
      font-weight: 600
      line-height: 1.4
      color: var(--text-highlight-color)
      display: -webkit-box
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical
      -webkit-line-clamp: 2
      transition: opacity .3s ease

    .hc-feat-dots
      display: flex
      gap: 4px
      margin-top: 7px

      i
        width: 5px
        height: 5px
        border-radius: 3px
        background: rgba(99, 125, 255, .3)
        transition: all .3s ease

      .hc-dot-on
        width: 14px
        background: var(--theme-toc-color)
        box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(99, 125, 255, .6)

  .hc-foot
    display: flex
    align-items: center
    margin-top: 10px
    font-family: consolas, Menlo, monospace
    font-size: .7em
    color: var(--card-meta)

    .hc-cursor
      margin-left: 2px
      color: var(--theme-toc-color)
      animation: hc-blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite

  @keyframes hc-pulse
    0%
      transform: scale(.6)
      opacity: .9

    100%
      transform: scale(1.9)
      opacity: 0

  @keyframes hc-orbit
    from
      transform: rotate(0deg) translateX(48px)

    to
      transform: rotate(360deg) translateX(48px)

  @keyframes hc-core-glow
    0%, 100%
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(99, 125, 255, .2)

    50%
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(99, 125, 255, .45)

  @keyframes hc-blink
    50%
      opacity: 0

// 作者卡内的站点统计与状态台卡重复，隐藏
.card-info
  .site-data
    display: none
